cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Harpd Rank Public Dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Open, machine-readable snapshot of the Harpd Rank board: AI and software products with their
  rank position, Rank Points, category, verification status and canonical profile URL, plus
  per-category aggregation and frozen monthly snapshots. Rank Points measure promotional
  placement (optional Credit spend), not product quality.
authors:
